===persian===

اگر ابرها بگذارند بلندترین سایه تو را
چون باغچه ای گل خواهم ..کاشت
و.... فصل نورت را .... آیه آیه...
بر حجم تاریکی خواهم نشاند....
اگر ابرها بگذارند
کوتاه ترین سایه مردی را که حاکم است و ظلم میکند
با تیر به زمین خواهم دوخت
آن گاه...
بلندترین سایه تو را که خوبی... که ساده ای
چون باغچه ای گل خواهم کاشت
.... مهربانی را با خون آب خواهم داد.
اگر ابرها بگذارند.

دهه ۱۳۴۰

===machine===

If the clouds leave your longest shadow
I will plant flowers like a garden
And.... the season of your light.... verse by verse...
I will plant it on the volume of darkness....
If the clouds leave
I will nail the shortest shadow of a man who rules and oppresses
to the ground with an arrow
Then...
Your longest shadow, who is good... who is simple
I will plant flowers like a garden
... I will water kindness with blood.
If the clouds leave.

1960s

===lantern===

If the clouds allow,
your longest shadow
I'll plant like a bed of flowers,
and your season of light, verse by verse,
I'll set against the bulk of the darkness...
If the clouds allow,
the shortest shadow of the man who rules and tyrannizes
I'll pin to the ground with an arrow.
Then...
your longest shadow — you who are good, who are simple —
I'll plant like a bed of flowers...
I'll water kindness with blood.
If the clouds allow.

1340s

